		1518 -> 1525;
	1519 [label="If it was a middling success, which was the most likely, cleanup would be required to ensure all loose strings were \"dealt with.\" Naturally, of course, I was one of those strings. And I had steps to ensure that I was still too valuable in the short term to be snipped with the rest.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1519 -> 1526;
