		1547 -> 1556;
	1549 [label="Hardly. But one thing you must understand about Orokin is that we were always scheming against each other. ",shape=box,color=blue];
		1549 -> 1550;
	1550 [label="I knew that Nitokh would kill me without hesitation at any point if it might even possibly aid her in the pursuit of her goals.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1550 -> 1558;
	1551 [label="I think she enjoyed the challenge, Usurper. The sense of danger. The thrill of knowing she was sleeping with someone who wanted her dead.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1551 -> 1559;
	1552 [label="I would like to pretend that we were the first Orokin to find themselves in such a situation, but it was not even that uncommon.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1552 -> 1559;
	1554 [label="Precisely! It is almost as though you have heard this before. But it is hardly a surprising twist. She taunted me with it quite regularly.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1554 -> 1543;
		1554 -> 1544;
	1553 [label="Precisely! But it is hardly a surprising twist. She saw it coming as well, and taunted me with it quite regularly.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1553 -> 1543;
		1553 -> 1544;
	1557 [label="I did not believe us to be equals, of course. She was an Executor. The Great Nitokh. But I thought myself First Amongst Her Lessers.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1557 -> 1561;
	1555 [label="You are adorable. Yes, in a manner of speaking, we were business partners. But we were also partners in many other more important ways.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1555 -> 1556;
	1556 [label="In war. In politics. In intrigue. In bed.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1556 -> 1560;
	1558 [label="Yet she knew that I was sharpening my knives behind her back and eagerly awaiting the moment where I would remove her head from her shoulders.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1558 -> 1562;
	1559 [label="The longer I live the more I realize we may not have been a species designed for immortality.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1559 -> 1563;
	1561 [label="What I fool I was...",shape=box,color=blue];
		1561 -> 1565;
		1561 -> 1566;
		1561 -> 1567;
		1561 -> 1568;
		1561 -> 1569;
	1560 [label="But I wonder if I am misremembering. I wonder if \"partner\" is too strong a word for what we really were. ",shape=box,color=blue];
		1560 -> 1564;
	1562 [label="You could say we had a... complex relationship.",shape=box,color=blue];
